OptiScaler   : $AUTO_OPTISCALER (optional plugin)
Transfer Q   : $AUTO_TRANSFER_QUEUE
Native AntiL : $AUTO_NATIVE_ANTILAG
Reflex Layer : $AUTO_REFLEX_LAYER
VK Video Dec : $AUTO_VK_VIDEO_DECODE
Bleeding-Edge: $AUTO_BLEEDING_EDGE
Steam Ctrl   : $AUTO_STEAM_CONTROLLER_MODE
